WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.000 --> 01:44.136
=Episode 10=

01:52.264 --> 01:54.624
(Actually, everyone has
their own struggles.)

01:55.104 --> 01:57.585
(Sometimes letting others go
is how you free yourself.)

01:57.904 --> 01:59.624
(I'm done with the pep talk.)

01:59.744 --> 02:00.705
(I just want to know)

02:00.865 --> 02:02.785
(she already had a boyfriend
before she met me,)

02:02.904 --> 02:04.104
(so why pretended to like me?)

02:04.384 --> 02:05.624
(Two years together.)

02:05.624 --> 02:07.104
(It hurts so much.)

02:14.984 --> 02:19.932
♪We've walked
through love's forbidden zones♪

02:36.305 --> 02:36.904
You're here.

02:39.025 --> 02:39.985
You got an eight.

02:47.184 --> 02:47.784
Look!

02:48.425 --> 02:49.224
Look familiar?

02:49.825 --> 02:52.064
Isn't that the traffic cop
who stopped us last time?

02:52.425 --> 02:53.385
It really is him.

02:53.784 --> 02:56.545
These days, anyone can just walk
into a shooting club.

02:56.545 --> 02:57.464
Who knows?

02:59.145 --> 03:00.425
To the restroom. I'll be back.

03:01.624 --> 03:03.064
Hey, man. Why'd you stop shooting?

03:03.385 --> 03:04.305
Since you're here,

03:04.305 --> 03:05.385
let's have a match.

03:06.624 --> 03:07.265
No, thanks.

03:07.744 --> 03:09.184
Hey, don't rush off.

03:09.504 --> 03:11.624
If you're not good, I can teach you.

03:12.865 --> 03:13.545
Really, no need.

03:13.825 --> 03:15.744
So you've got the guts to fine us,

03:15.744 --> 03:17.224
but you're too chicken to compete?

03:17.464 --> 03:18.464
Are you chickening out?

03:18.624 --> 03:19.344
Chicken!

03:21.825 --> 03:22.865
If you can't afford it,

03:23.464 --> 03:24.184
I'll pay for you.

03:24.904 --> 03:25.664
Pick any gun.

03:27.705 --> 03:28.464
I'll play with you.

04:08.105 --> 04:08.944
Got things to do.

04:09.184 --> 04:10.385
Let's play next time.

04:34.825 --> 04:35.464
Talk to me.

04:35.984 --> 04:37.185
What's bothering you?

04:42.825 --> 04:43.945
What's going on?

04:44.544 --> 04:46.424
You're not yourself today.

04:47.825 --> 04:52.304
Some things just can't be controlled,
no matter how hard you try.

04:53.065 --> 04:54.185
Just like shooting.

04:54.904 --> 04:56.424
Even if you aim, you might miss.

04:58.745 --> 04:59.585
Business troubles?

05:05.224 --> 05:07.424
I don't understand business,

05:08.145 --> 05:12.265
but it feels a lot
like relationships sometimes.

05:13.224 --> 05:16.664
You chase someone forever,
only to end up empty-handed.

05:21.424 --> 05:24.344
So if something isn't meant for you,

05:25.104 --> 05:25.904
would you let it go?

05:35.784 --> 05:38.464
Yes. If I knew it was impossible,

05:38.904 --> 05:40.104
and it was best for them,

05:41.705 --> 05:42.544
I would.

05:42.945 --> 05:44.464
You wouldn't shoot even it's targeted?

05:46.664 --> 05:47.864
What's wrong with you today?

05:49.705 --> 05:51.145
You're not like me.

05:51.864 --> 05:53.585
What could you want that you can't have?

06:02.104 --> 06:03.745
Is there someone you can't let go of?

06:09.945 --> 06:10.784
One more round.

06:45.984 --> 06:48.784
- To Xiaojue's smooth studies.
- To Xiaojue's smooth studies.

06:57.065 --> 06:59.104
Don't go changing your heart
once you're in England.

06:59.664 --> 07:02.104
Or I'll fly straight there
and hunt you down.

07:04.385 --> 07:05.145
Xiaojue,

07:06.625 --> 07:08.385
Mengmeng must have been just joking.

07:10.065 --> 07:11.945
We all know you'd never change.

07:15.104 --> 07:16.745
But after you go to England,

07:17.984 --> 07:19.145
you have to write to me.

07:19.664 --> 07:22.025
Okay. And you have
to take good care of yourself too.

07:22.585 --> 07:23.265
Don't worry.

07:24.065 --> 07:26.104
I'll miss you so much over there.

07:26.104 --> 07:27.145
And I'll worry about you.

07:31.065 --> 07:32.065
Tiehan, Mengmeng.

07:33.145 --> 07:34.185
We're all classmates.

07:34.945 --> 07:35.705
After I go abroad,

07:38.185 --> 07:39.505
I leave Huan'er in your care.

07:40.304 --> 07:40.945
Don't worry.

07:41.904 --> 07:42.745
It's okay.

07:43.904 --> 07:45.745
I can take care of myself.

07:46.544 --> 07:47.224
No!

07:48.065 --> 07:49.104
What I mean is,

07:49.705 --> 07:51.065
I want you to keep an eye on her.

07:52.224 --> 07:53.544
Don't let anyone steal you away.

07:56.145 --> 07:56.945
How could I?

07:58.224 --> 07:58.904
No one could.

08:10.344 --> 08:11.544
If you don't eat the peanuts,

08:11.544 --> 08:12.424
I'll take them.

08:13.904 --> 08:15.145
Stop eating.

08:15.424 --> 08:16.424
Eat the dishes first.

08:17.424 --> 08:18.025
Xiaojue,

08:18.505 --> 08:19.265
try this.

08:19.265 --> 08:19.984
Have a taste.

08:20.904 --> 08:22.945
I hear England doesn't have good food.

08:22.945 --> 08:24.025
Eat as much as you can now.

08:28.585 --> 08:29.505
We haven't parted yet,

08:30.145 --> 08:31.224
and I already miss you.

08:32.784 --> 08:33.664
Me too.

08:39.625 --> 08:40.936
Not eating this? I'll take it.

08:45.904 --> 08:46.664
You eat more too.

08:52.345 --> 08:55.064
You Silly Goose! If I don't call you,

08:55.064 --> 08:56.544
you won't call me, will you?

08:56.944 --> 08:58.424
All you do is avoiding me every day.

08:58.424 --> 08:59.584
Just avoid me!

09:04.167 --> 09:05.128
(Incoming Call: Silly Goose)

09:12.944 --> 09:13.465
Hello?

09:14.145 --> 09:14.824
Hello? Mengmeng.

09:15.304 --> 09:16.304
Are you free tomorrow?

09:17.745 --> 09:18.345
Yes.

09:20.424 --> 09:22.664
Good. Let's meet at school tomorrow.

09:22.664 --> 09:23.704
Not back for a long time.

09:23.704 --> 09:24.704
Let's go look around.

09:25.224 --> 09:25.944
Okay.

09:32.584 --> 09:35.304
Silly Goose, that's not what I meant.

09:35.584 --> 09:37.664
You're the best, the sweetest.

09:38.225 --> 09:38.784
Love you.

10:04.345 --> 10:05.225
(Dear friend,)

10:05.424 --> 10:08.664
(I'll be here 24/7
to solve your problems.)

10:22.728 --> 10:24.840
(Yunsheng Tower)

10:26.465 --> 10:28.304
Miss Lin, come with me.

10:31.985 --> 10:32.505
Mr. Fang.

10:33.345 --> 10:34.704
Mr. Gao, why are you here?

10:35.385 --> 10:36.064
I'm here

10:36.064 --> 10:37.465
mainly to invite Miss Lin

10:37.584 --> 10:40.304
to oversee marketing for Letao's
upcoming women's product line.

10:41.265 --> 10:43.145
Letao and Yunsheng
will continue collaborating.

10:43.465 --> 10:45.512
We'll even add 3 percent
to the commission.

10:46.265 --> 10:49.145
Plus, Miss Lin will handle
all liaisons for Letao.

10:49.225 --> 10:49.985
No problem.

10:50.345 --> 10:51.865
I've already had the contract drafted.

10:54.265 --> 10:56.584
Could you perhaps ask
the actual person involved?

10:57.225 --> 10:57.944
Are you willing?

10:57.944 --> 10:58.465
No.

10:58.465 --> 10:59.704
Yes, absolutely!

10:59.944 --> 11:00.745
She must be willing.

11:00.745 --> 11:02.745
I'll remove Miss Lin's workstation now.

11:02.745 --> 11:03.505
No!

11:03.584 --> 11:05.345
You're burning bridges.

11:05.345 --> 11:06.824
You're basically kidnapping, get it?

11:07.784 --> 11:08.304
Did I?

11:08.824 --> 11:09.505
I'm taking her.

11:09.505 --> 11:10.064
Absolutely.

11:10.064 --> 11:10.544
You did.

11:10.544 --> 11:11.584
- Take her away right now.
- You did.

11:11.745 --> 11:12.664
Take her this instant!

11:12.664 --> 11:13.304
No way.

11:13.304 --> 11:14.105
Take her away now!

11:14.105 --> 11:15.345
- What boss are you?
- You must take her!

11:15.465 --> 11:16.824
Pleasure doing business.

11:16.824 --> 11:17.704
Don't worry about it.

11:17.704 --> 11:19.784
I'll have someone move
your workstation right away.

11:20.808 --> 11:21.864
Pleasure working with you.

11:46.625 --> 11:47.424
Hu Tiehan.

11:49.904 --> 11:51.105
You arrived so early?

11:52.944 --> 11:54.265
I'm on duty this afternoon.

11:56.904 --> 11:57.465
Let's go.

12:00.944 --> 12:04.345
Remember the first time we spoke?

12:07.304 --> 12:08.145
Not really.

12:08.745 --> 12:10.345
It hasn't even been that long.

12:11.625 --> 12:12.544
But understandable.

12:12.944 --> 12:15.625
All you cared
about back then were sports.

12:16.145 --> 12:17.345
No surprise you forgot.

12:42.025 --> 12:43.465
Well, Hu...

12:44.225 --> 12:45.345
My name is Hu Tiehan.

12:45.944 --> 12:46.784
Hu Tiehan.

12:47.265 --> 12:49.944
I might hold you back
in the sports meet.

12:51.225 --> 12:51.865
It's fine.

12:52.064 --> 12:52.985
Need more practice.

12:58.904 --> 12:59.625
Sorry about that.

13:01.064 --> 13:02.225
No worries. Keep going.

13:04.145 --> 13:06.105
We barely interacted before.

13:06.345 --> 13:07.944
Worried we wouldn't sync well.

13:08.424 --> 13:10.465
But we actually have good chemistry.

13:11.064 --> 13:12.544
We must win this sports meet.

13:13.664 --> 13:15.304
Is winning really that important?

13:15.304 --> 13:16.424
Of course.

13:16.625 --> 13:17.584
Either do it properly,

13:17.584 --> 13:18.944
or don't do it at all.

13:20.465 --> 13:21.225
These days,

13:21.225 --> 13:22.745
let's keep practicing after class.

13:23.225 --> 13:23.625
Okay.

13:37.985 --> 13:38.944
By the way, Mengmeng.

13:40.745 --> 13:42.745
How's Huan'er and Xiaojue lately?

13:43.265 --> 13:44.345
What do you mean?

13:45.745 --> 13:48.105
Hasn't Huan'er mentioned anything?

13:49.345 --> 13:52.064
She rarely talks about Xiaojue now.

13:52.505 --> 13:54.145
Probably swamped with work.

13:54.145 --> 13:55.544
Leaves early, and comes home late.

13:58.824 --> 14:00.025
Why ask?

14:00.625 --> 14:01.704
Did Xiaojue contact you?

14:02.904 --> 14:03.465
No.

14:04.025 --> 14:05.745
Nothing. Just curious.

14:07.145 --> 14:08.105
Hu Tiehan,

14:08.704 --> 14:10.824
you didn't ask me
out just for this, right?

14:11.304 --> 14:12.664
Couldn't you have called instead?

14:14.784 --> 14:15.465
No.

14:16.664 --> 14:17.704
Mengmeng, you know.

14:18.424 --> 14:20.625
Xiaojue asked me to look out
for her before he left.

14:20.625 --> 14:21.184
Okay.

14:23.025 --> 14:25.424
I knew it. You only call
when you need something.

14:29.544 --> 14:31.184
Let's make the most of our time then.

14:31.345 --> 14:32.904
Don't you have duty soon?

14:42.625 --> 14:43.465
Mr. Gao arranged it.

14:43.465 --> 14:44.304
This is your desk.

14:45.184 --> 14:45.584
Thank you.

14:46.584 --> 14:47.904
A new colleague Mr. Gao arranged?

14:48.424 --> 14:49.625
Did you get wind of this?

14:49.985 --> 14:50.664
No.

14:56.184 --> 14:56.664
Hey.

14:57.225 --> 14:59.025
Should we go say hello then?

14:59.584 --> 15:00.184
Let's go.

15:04.584 --> 15:05.145
Hello,

15:05.904 --> 15:06.584
(Zhao Jia)
I'm Zhao Jia.

15:06.745 --> 15:07.865
(Qian Bing)
Hello, I'm Qian Bing.

15:08.025 --> 15:09.145
(Sun Yi)
Hello, I'm Sun Yi.

15:10.385 --> 15:11.105
Jia, Yi, Bing?

15:11.265 --> 15:14.985
Your NPC names seem a bit random,
don't they? How imaginative.

15:17.145 --> 15:17.544
Miss Lin.

15:17.544 --> 15:17.944
Yes.

15:19.544 --> 15:22.304
Mr. Gao said the marketing plan
you did earlier was excellent.

15:22.465 --> 15:23.505
Just needs a few tweaks.

15:23.505 --> 15:24.465
He's already noted them.

15:24.944 --> 15:26.505
Got it. I'll revise it this afternoon.

15:26.745 --> 15:28.745
Here's the related information
and product samples.

15:29.105 --> 15:31.625
Review it and provide a revised plan
by the end of today.

15:37.704 --> 15:38.465
Go, go, go!

16:25.985 --> 16:26.544
Mr. Gao.

16:30.345 --> 16:31.664
I'm done with today's work.

16:33.865 --> 16:35.225
Need me to bring you some supper?

16:35.985 --> 16:36.544
Sure.

16:36.904 --> 16:37.664
The usual?

16:40.385 --> 16:40.944
Wait.

16:55.265 --> 16:56.145
Luo, I'll leave first.

16:56.304 --> 16:56.865
Appreciate it.

17:05.425 --> 17:06.064
Thanks.

17:06.824 --> 17:09.265
But I've almost finished
the tasks Mr. Gao assigned me.

17:09.745 --> 17:10.624
Just a moment, I'll...

17:10.624 --> 17:11.240
You're welcome.

17:12.705 --> 17:14.864
Mr. Gao said the plan you made
this afternoon is good.

17:14.864 --> 17:16.104
But it needs a few adjustments.

17:16.104 --> 17:16.985
He's marked them out.

17:17.104 --> 17:18.144
Get it done tonight.

17:18.425 --> 17:19.025
Good luck.

17:21.425 --> 17:22.025
Wait.

17:50.544 --> 17:51.544
Don't even ask.

17:51.544 --> 17:54.144
I was absolutely slammed today.

17:54.304 --> 17:57.025
My boss, I don't know
what got into him today. He...

17:59.784 --> 18:01.544
Can't talk now.
I'm getting in the elevator.

18:06.265 --> 18:07.745
You seemed very dissatisfied with me.

18:09.945 --> 18:11.985
Not as much resentment
as you harbor towards me.

18:14.144 --> 18:15.985
Still, thanks for the wontons.

18:16.344 --> 18:18.745
They taste a bit like the ones
from that place

18:18.745 --> 18:19.745
we ate at before.

18:20.544 --> 18:21.425
Luo grabbed randomly.

18:22.064 --> 18:22.705
No wonder.

18:22.905 --> 18:24.265
The taste isn't quite the same.

18:26.144 --> 18:26.665
Really?

18:27.304 --> 18:29.384
Yes, it's perfectly normal.

18:29.945 --> 18:31.544
Yesterday's wontons and today's wontons

18:31.544 --> 18:33.144
can't possibly taste exactly identical.

18:33.505 --> 18:34.425
Just like people.

18:34.905 --> 18:36.584
Someone might be fine yesterday,

18:36.945 --> 18:38.705
but suddenly start
acting so harsh today.

18:39.425 --> 18:40.144
What do you mean?

18:40.945 --> 18:42.505
Mr. Gao, aren't you heading home?

18:42.864 --> 18:44.104
What else would I be doing?

18:44.544 --> 18:46.304
I thought you were waiting for someone.

18:46.505 --> 18:47.705
You didn't press the button.

18:49.465 --> 18:50.225
Got it.

18:50.225 --> 18:51.864
Boss, let me press it for you.

18:59.864 --> 19:01.104
(Huan'er, I bought supper.)

19:01.225 --> 19:02.505
(Let's eat together at home.)

19:05.425 --> 19:06.104
(No, thanks.)

19:15.185 --> 19:16.465
(I already ate at the office.)

19:29.265 --> 19:30.905
By the way, can I expense the cab fare?

19:36.025 --> 19:36.824
You're back.

19:40.064 --> 19:40.905
Listen.

19:41.584 --> 19:43.265
This Gao Haiming...

19:43.864 --> 19:45.665
He must have some weird fetish.

19:46.025 --> 19:47.544
He just loves tormenting people.

19:47.824 --> 19:48.584
What did he do?

19:49.945 --> 19:50.905
He's tormenting me.

19:51.544 --> 19:53.505
He tried so hard
to transfer me to Letao,

19:53.505 --> 19:54.425
right next to him,

19:54.705 --> 19:56.745
just to make it easier to torment me.

19:56.745 --> 19:58.384
He wants me to work myself to death.

19:59.665 --> 20:00.824
Well, that's a relief.

20:02.665 --> 20:05.505
Tiehan actually asked me
about you and Xiaojue today.

20:06.624 --> 20:07.584
What did he ask?

20:08.104 --> 20:10.465
Just how you are doing lately,

20:10.465 --> 20:11.745
and if you've been arguing.

20:12.344 --> 20:15.265
I felt you've been getting a bit close
to Gao Haiming recently.

20:16.185 --> 20:16.945
But now, it seems

20:16.945 --> 20:18.465
he's exploiting you so hard,

20:18.864 --> 20:19.985
so I feel much better.

20:22.864 --> 20:23.705
Have a drink.

20:29.265 --> 20:29.905
Mengmeng,

20:31.064 --> 20:32.705
why do you like Hu Tiehan so much?

20:32.985 --> 20:34.384
He doesn't even treat you well.

20:34.465 --> 20:35.945
He treats me very well.

20:35.945 --> 20:37.104
You don't know.

20:37.784 --> 20:38.624
Zhu Mengmeng.

20:45.384 --> 20:46.745
What do you want?

20:49.104 --> 20:51.025
I have money. Take it.

20:52.544 --> 20:53.064
Don't.

20:54.225 --> 20:55.104
It'll be endless then.

20:55.505 --> 20:56.304
What do you mean?

20:57.225 --> 20:58.225
Playing the hero, huh?

20:58.624 --> 21:01.425
Maybe he sees that Zhu Mengmeng is rich
and wants to borrow some too.

21:03.104 --> 21:04.665
I'm warning you. Don't cause trouble.

21:05.304 --> 21:06.344
We're doing it anyway.

21:06.945 --> 21:07.544
What?

21:11.624 --> 21:12.344
Mr. Zhang?

21:15.225 --> 21:16.544
I won't let you off the hook!

21:24.025 --> 21:24.905
Thank you.

21:25.384 --> 21:26.504
It's okay. Glad you're safe.

21:27.384 --> 21:28.344
Let me walk you home.

21:28.544 --> 21:30.384
Will they cause trouble for you later?

21:31.624 --> 21:32.225
I'm not afraid.

21:32.465 --> 21:33.025
Let's go.

21:41.985 --> 21:43.905
Isn't playing the hero a bit cliché,

21:43.905 --> 21:44.584
Mengmeng?

21:44.945 --> 21:45.824
Huan'er!

21:45.824 --> 21:46.705
Fine.

21:47.025 --> 21:48.064
As long as you like it.

21:54.104 --> 21:54.665
Mengmeng,

21:54.665 --> 21:56.344
why is this hydrating mist here?

21:57.304 --> 21:59.265
My friend brought it back from England.

22:00.344 --> 22:00.985
England?

22:02.144 --> 22:03.544
(He's targeting me like this.)

22:03.824 --> 22:05.465
(Could it be because he's jealous?)

22:06.064 --> 22:08.185
(Maybe I should test it.)

22:08.344 --> 22:10.304
Do you want it? I can get you a new one.

22:10.384 --> 22:12.624
No. Just lend me this one for a day.

22:13.144 --> 22:13.665
Sure.

22:16.360 --> 22:17.096
Morning, Mr. Gao.

22:17.304 --> 22:17.784
Mr. Gao.

22:18.144 --> 22:18.544
Morning.

22:19.505 --> 22:20.025
Mr. Gao.

22:20.624 --> 22:21.064
Morning.

22:23.272 --> 22:24.025
Morning, Mr. Gao.

22:24.025 --> 22:24.384
Morning.

22:32.824 --> 22:33.505
Huan'er,

22:33.745 --> 22:34.505
what's this?

22:35.344 --> 22:36.104
Hydrating mist.

22:37.225 --> 22:38.945
My friend from England gave it to me.

22:39.265 --> 22:40.544
It works really well. Try it.

23:08.425 --> 23:10.144
Isn't it just a hydrating mist?

23:10.945 --> 23:12.104
It isn't necessarily that...

23:12.104 --> 23:12.985
Did I talk to you?

23:19.505 --> 23:21.824
Sir, call me if you need anything.

23:24.945 --> 23:27.945
Is Mr. Huang coming back
from Hong Kong, China today?

23:28.544 --> 23:28.945
Yes.

23:29.945 --> 23:31.745
Tell him to call me.
Bring something for me.

23:32.505 --> 23:33.104
Bring what?

23:33.544 --> 23:34.472
Did I allow you to ask?

23:57.053 --> 23:57.992
(Letao Tower)

23:59.544 --> 24:00.144
It's for you.

24:00.745 --> 24:01.384
From who?

24:01.665 --> 24:02.696
Did I allow you to ask?

24:03.784 --> 24:04.544
Scrap the old one.

24:19.544 --> 24:21.624
(Bought so much?
Planning to bathe in it?)

24:22.665 --> 24:25.225
(Is he trying to charm me to death?)

24:29.144 --> 24:31.624
Well, dear colleagues.

24:32.104 --> 24:32.968
It's from my friend.

24:33.144 --> 24:34.544
A whole box. Everyone gets one.

24:35.025 --> 24:35.624
Here you go.

24:37.824 --> 24:39.745
- Thanks, Huan'er.
- Thanks, Huan'er.

24:39.745 --> 24:41.025
- Nothing.
- You're so generous.

24:41.025 --> 24:41.705
It's high-end.

24:41.705 --> 24:42.745
We rarely see it usually.

24:43.064 --> 24:43.544
Take it.

24:43.688 --> 24:44.505
Thank you, Huan'er.

25:10.265 --> 25:10.985
Hello?

25:11.745 --> 25:12.624
Starting tomorrow,

25:13.104 --> 25:14.784
you'll replace Luo
as my special assistant.

25:15.304 --> 25:16.665
Pick me up for work at 7 AM.

25:18.344 --> 25:19.064
Mr. Gao?

25:19.945 --> 25:21.745
You know my home address very well.

25:22.225 --> 25:24.384
One minute late,
and I'll deduct a full day's pay.

25:25.945 --> 25:26.624
Fine.

25:26.745 --> 25:29.025
But it's already very late, so...

25:29.665 --> 25:30.304
Hello?

25:37.064 --> 25:38.144
Playing games, huh?

25:40.344 --> 25:40.945
Alright then.

25:50.265 --> 25:52.745
Miss Lin, you can wait inside.

25:52.745 --> 25:53.665
I'll call Mr. Gao down.

25:53.945 --> 25:54.665
It's okay.

25:55.225 --> 25:55.945
Don't tell him.

25:55.945 --> 25:57.144
He can come down anytime.

25:57.144 --> 25:57.945
I'll wait here.

25:58.104 --> 26:00.185
I'm not rushing him at all.

26:00.505 --> 26:01.425
Okay, wait a moment.

26:29.864 --> 26:30.425
Mr. Gao.

26:31.344 --> 26:32.624
Miss Lin is waiting outside.

26:32.824 --> 26:33.624
She seems rushed.

26:34.185 --> 26:34.824
I see.

27:02.344 --> 27:03.144
Morning, Mr. Gao.

27:03.665 --> 27:04.225
Morning.

27:05.144 --> 27:06.064
Let's go. Head out.

27:06.064 --> 27:06.544
Wait.

27:09.144 --> 27:10.905
This bowtie of yours

27:11.745 --> 27:12.824
isn't tied very well.

27:13.425 --> 27:14.665
Let me tie it again for you.

27:15.864 --> 27:16.384
Okay.

27:54.304 --> 27:57.344
I've tied you an Eldredge knot.

27:58.344 --> 28:00.225
This knot might look a bit exaggerated.

28:00.624 --> 28:02.784
But since your suit today
is quite understated,

28:02.784 --> 28:03.745
and the tie is bold,

28:03.745 --> 28:05.144
it balances things out perfectly.

28:08.265 --> 28:09.064
How did you know it?

28:10.304 --> 28:12.064
I specifically studied this.

28:14.665 --> 28:15.784
Why would you study that?

28:16.945 --> 28:17.465
Well...

28:18.824 --> 28:22.304
Of course, it was for a certain man.

28:27.336 --> 28:28.544
Not going to the office today.

28:28.544 --> 28:29.425
No need to drive me.

28:37.905 --> 28:39.425
I learned it especially for you.

28:40.745 --> 28:41.544
That won't do?

28:43.425 --> 28:44.104
Are you crazy?

29:01.544 --> 29:02.665
(Why would you study that?)

29:03.344 --> 29:04.905
Of course, it was for a certain man.

29:32.985 --> 29:33.896
You're here, Huan'er.

29:52.544 --> 29:54.425
Huan'er, why are you so late today?

29:55.945 --> 29:57.304
All thanks to a certain someone.

30:01.144 --> 30:02.144
When did he get here?

30:02.945 --> 30:03.624
Mr. Gao?

30:04.344 --> 30:07.025
He arrived super early this morning.
Before nine, I think.

30:08.064 --> 30:08.784
Really?

30:11.225 --> 30:12.544
(What appointment?)

30:12.624 --> 30:13.584
(He's targeting me.)

30:14.384 --> 30:15.624
(Playing games with me, huh?)

30:16.025 --> 30:17.784
(Fine, I'm done putting up with this.)

30:31.544 --> 30:32.344
Are you sure?

30:32.505 --> 30:33.584
Absolutely sure.

30:34.344 --> 30:35.864
So much work and the cold shoulder.

30:35.864 --> 30:37.505
Of course, she's overwhelmed.

30:38.344 --> 30:38.945
Luo,

30:39.505 --> 30:43.265
do you think Mr. Gao
and Lin Huan'er are...

30:45.505 --> 30:46.905
But it is really too much.

30:51.544 --> 30:52.304
What are you doing?

30:52.745 --> 30:53.465
Get back to work!

31:08.584 --> 31:09.185
Sir,

31:09.864 --> 31:12.344
on Lin Huan'er, are we being too...

31:13.425 --> 31:14.344
It's all her fault.

31:32.384 --> 31:33.304
(Email)
(Ou Xiaojue?)

31:34.344 --> 31:35.745
(Right, what does he look like?)

32:06.185 --> 32:07.745
Mr. Gao, do you have any instructions?

32:09.144 --> 32:09.705
Come with me.

32:16.624 --> 32:18.144
(Finally, you lose patience, huh?)

32:20.505 --> 32:20.985
Tiehan.

32:21.584 --> 32:22.505
Come on. Grab a meal.

32:22.665 --> 32:23.905
We finally wrapped things up.

32:24.544 --> 32:25.864
No, thanks. You guys go ahead.

32:26.344 --> 32:27.384
Everyone's waiting there.

32:27.945 --> 32:29.025
Got things to do. You go.

32:30.025 --> 32:30.465
Okay.

32:31.505 --> 32:32.745
I'll head over first then.

32:33.104 --> 32:33.584
Take care.

32:33.584 --> 32:34.025
Okay.

32:43.741 --> 32:45.480
(Mengmeng, have time? We need to talk.)

32:58.465 --> 33:00.025
The atmosphere here is really quiet.

33:00.064 --> 33:01.265
The food tastes good too.

33:01.425 --> 33:02.905
Take a look. See what you like.

33:03.225 --> 33:03.584
Okay.

33:08.253 --> 33:10.285
(Snow Velvet Moon Gazing, 66 yuan)

33:13.905 --> 33:15.425
Snow Velvet Moon Gazing is delicious.

33:19.665 --> 33:21.344
(Eel Claypot Rice, 88 yuan)
This Eel Claypot Rice is also good.

33:27.344 --> 33:27.985
What's wrong?

33:28.824 --> 33:29.784
Nothing you like to eat?

33:30.665 --> 33:31.624
Should we try another?

33:32.265 --> 33:33.705
No, no need. This place is fine.

33:38.745 --> 33:39.465
Excuse me.

33:43.784 --> 33:45.465
One Snow Velvet Moon Gazing, please.

33:45.465 --> 33:47.144
And one Eel Claypot Rice, thank you.

33:47.544 --> 33:48.144
Make that two.

33:48.905 --> 33:49.465
Thanks.

33:49.784 --> 33:51.584
Okay, please wait a moment.

34:11.465 --> 34:12.064
Hu?

34:15.025 --> 34:15.624
Mengmeng?

34:16.025 --> 34:16.584
Huan'er?

34:22.953 --> 34:25.936
♪Entwined worries linger♪

34:27.145 --> 34:29.916
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

34:31.817 --> 34:37.730
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

34:39.527 --> 34:42.587
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

34:43.753 --> 34:47.205
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

34:48.201 --> 34:53.727
♪Until the world's end♪

34:56.137 --> 34:59.933
♪If I could♪

35:00.521 --> 35:03.337
♪Keep loving you♪

35:04.361 --> 35:06.761
♪Hearing two hearts♪

35:06.761 --> 35:11.677
♪Beating together♪

35:12.649 --> 35:16.513
♪If I could♪

35:16.513 --> 35:19.753
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

35:20.809 --> 35:28.134
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

